  "solution": "Xét hai biến cố<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Người thứ nhất bắn trúng mục tiêu””.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>: ““ Người thứ hai bắn trúng mục tiêu””.<br>Suy ra<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></semantics></math>: ““ Người thứ nhất bắn không trúng mục tiêu””.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></semantics></math>: ““ Người thứ hai bắn không trúng mục tiêu””.<br>Ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://ww